@node Main "MintVID Guide"
@{b}MintVID@{ub} - a codec-agnostic video player for real 68k AmigaOS
hardware, from a stock A600/AGA up to a PiStorm/RTG machine.

This is the on-Amiga companion to the plain-text MintVID.readme. Pick a
topic below (click, or press Return on a highlighted link):

  @{" Overview "            Link Overview}
